    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2146310/extras/63285971aa5fd507ea281539a639e14c.poster.avif?t=1754921990\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2146310/extras/63285971aa5fd507ea281539a639e14c.webm?t=1754921990\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2146310/extras/63285971aa5fd507ea281539a639e14c.mp4?t=1754921990\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">King of the Hill</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Battle it out in chaotic arenas where only one can hold the cup. Stay on top to score\u2014but everyone else is coming for your throne, and they\u2019ll do whatever it takes to knock you down.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2146310/extras/5c1d439c34cfe05b093053e718456efc.poster.avif?t=1754921990\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2146310/extras/5c1d439c34cfe05b093053e718456efc.webm?t=1754921990\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2146310/extras/5c1d439c34cfe05b093053e718456efc.mp4?t=1754921990\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2146310/extras/23c2e75721157474ab41309485101cc5.poster.avif?t=1754921990\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2146310/extras/23c2e75721157474ab41309485101cc5.webm?t=1754921990\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2146310/extras/23c2e75721157474ab41309485101cc5.mp4?t=1754921990\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Play with your friends</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Jump into the madness with your crew or go full free-for-all. Team up, betray, laugh, scream\u2014every match becomes personal when your friends are in the arena. And if you\u2019re looking for new rivals (or allies), our Discord community is super welcoming and always ready to rumble with new players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2146310/extras/5c1d439c34cfe05b093053e718456efc.poster.avif?t=1754921990\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2146310/extras/5c1d439c34cfe05b093053e718456efc.webm?t=1754921990\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2146310/extras/5c1d439c34cfe05b093053e718456efc.mp4?t=1754921990\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2146310/extras/2dbbe29629910b9cdeda22c10ce3711a.poster.avif?t=1754921990\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2146310/extras/2dbbe29629910b9cdeda22c10ce3711a.webm?t=1754921990\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2146310/extras/2dbbe29629910b9cdeda22c10ce3711a.mp4?t=1754921990\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Customize your champion</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Style your fighter with wild outfits, spooky masks, and absurd skins. Intimidate, distract, or just look ridiculous while you rumble. Victory is great\u2014dripping in soul-powered fashion is better.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2146310/extras/5c1d439c34cfe05b093053e718456efc.poster.avif?t=1754921990\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2146310/extras/5c1d439c34cfe05b093053e718456efc.webm?t=1754921990\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2146310/extras/5c1d439c34cfe05b093053e718456efc.mp4?t=1754921990\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2146310/extras/8499b6613b364913a9ee64e76109bdfe.poster.avif?t=1754921990\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2146310/extras/8499b6613b364913a9ee64e76109bdfe.webm?t=1754921990\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2146310/extras/8499b6613b364913a9ee64e76109bdfe.mp4?t=1754921990\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2146310/extras/81f5de2af292c29560f7e15c49a4a2fe.poster.avif?t=1754921990\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2146310/extras/81f5de2af292c29560f7e15c49a4a2fe.webm?t=1754921990\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2146310/extras/81f5de2af292c29560f7e15c49a4a2fe.mp4?t=1754921990\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Choose your artifact</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Before each match, pick two powerful artifacts to bring into battle. Once you're in, collect enough souls to activate them\u2014then unleash chaos by freezing your rivals, knocking them off the map, or turning invisible to strike when they least expect it. Use them wisely\u2026 or combine them for the ultimate power move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2146310/extras/5c1d439c34cfe05b093053e718456efc.poster.avif?t=1754921990\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2146310/extras/5c1d439c34cfe05b093053e718456efc.webm?t=1754921990\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2146310/extras/5c1d439c34cfe05b093053e718456efc.mp4?t=1754921990\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2146310/extras/c26324cf37867f77eee6f9796f0e0fd0.poster.avif?t=1754921990\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2146310/extras/c26324cf37867f77eee6f9796f0e0fd0.webm?t=1754921990\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2146310/extras/c26324cf37867f77eee6f9796f0e0fd0.mp4?t=1754921990\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Collect Souls\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Souls fuel your strategy. Gather them throughout the match to activate your artifacts and gain the upper hand. Every soul brings you one step closer to total chaos</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br> <br> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2146310/extras/5c1d439c34cfe05b093053e718456efc.poster.avif?t=1754921990\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2146310/extras/5c1d439c34cfe05b093053e718456efc.webm?t=1754921990\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2146310/extras/5c1d439c34cfe05b093053e718456efc.mp4?t=1754921990\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2146310/extras/ba56302291a7390f9d6f1597b0eb348e.poster.avif?t=1754921990\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2146310/extras/ba56302291a7390f9d6f1597b0eb348e.webm?t=1754921990\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2146310/extras/ba56302291a7390f9d6f1597b0eb348e.mp4?t=1754921990\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Reach to the Top</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Climbing is only half the battle. Bounce, dash, and punch your way up while dodging traps\u2014and the fists of every other contender fighting for control.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2146310/extras/5c1d439c34cfe05b093053e718456efc.poster.avif?t=1754921990\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2146310/extras/5c1d439c34cfe05b093053e718456efc.webm?t=1754921990\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2146310/extras/5c1d439c34cfe05b093053e718456efc.mp4?t=1754921990\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2146310/extras/2652269478904f0867e66f1eaaba4ac4.poster.avif?t=1754921990\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2146310/extras/2652269478904f0867e66f1eaaba4ac4.webm?t=1754921990\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2146310/extras/2652269478904f0867e66f1eaaba4ac4.mp4?t=1754921990\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><strong>Don\u2019t Fall</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Falling doesn\u2019t kill you\u2014but it costs you precious time. Every second counts in these intense 5\u20137 minute matches, and while you're scrambling to climb back up, others are racking up points. The top is a war zone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p>",
