tag\">Choose your artifact</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Before each match, pick two powerful artifacts to bring into battle. Once you're in, collect enough souls to activate them\u2014then unleash chaos by freezing your rivals, knocking them off the map, or turning invisible to strike when they least expect it. Use them wisely\u2026 or combine them for the ultimate power move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2146310/extras/5c1d439c34cfe05b093053e718456efc.poster.avif?t=1754921990\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2146310/extras/5c1d439c34cfe05b093053e718456efc.webm?t=1754921990\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2146310/extras/5c1d439c34cfe05b093053e718456efc.mp4?t=1754921990\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2146310/extras/c26324cf37867f77eee6f9796f0e0fd0.poster.avif?t=1754921990\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2146310/extras/c26324cf37867f77eee6f9796f0e0fd0.webm?t=1754921990\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2146310/extras/c26324cf37867f77eee6f9796f0e0fd0.mp4?t=1754921990\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Collect Souls\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Souls fuel your strategy. Gather them throughout the match to activate your artifacts and gain the upper hand. Every soul brings you one step closer to total chaos</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br> <br> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2146310/extras/5c1d439c34cfe05b093053e718456efc.poster.avif?t=1754921990\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2146310/extras/5c1d439c34cfe05b093053e718456efc.webm?t=1754921990\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2146310/extras/5c1d439c34cfe05b093053e718456efc.mp4?t=1754921990\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2146310/extras/ba56302291a7390f9d6f1597b0eb348e.poster.avif?t=1754921990\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2146310/extras/ba56302291a7390f9d6f1597b0eb348e.webm?t=1754921990\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2146310/extras/ba56302291a7390f9d6f1597b0eb348e.mp4?t=1754921990\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Reach to the Top</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Climbing is only half the battle. Bounce, dash, and punch your way up while dodging traps\u2014and the fists of every other contender fighting for control.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2146310/extras/5c1d439c34cfe05b093053e718456efc.poster.avif?t=1754921990\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2146310/extras/5c1d439c34cfe05b093053e718456efc.webm?t=1754921990\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2146310/extras/5c1d439c34cfe05b093053e718456efc.mp4?t=1754921990\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2146310/extras/2652269478904f0867e66f1eaaba4ac4.poster.avif?t=1754921990\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2146310/extras/2652269478904f0867e66f1eaaba4ac4.webm?t=1754921990\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2146310/extras/2652269478904f0867e66f1eaaba4ac4.mp4?t=1754921990\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><strong>Don\u2019t Fall</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Falling doesn\u2019t kill you\u2014but it costs you precious time. Every second counts in these intense 5\u20137 minute matches, and while you're scrambling to climb back up, others are racking up points. The top is a war zone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p>",
    "short_description": "Welcome to DKR a chaotic 6-player party brawler where you bounce, punch, and outwit your friends (or enemies) in explosive arenas full of traps and nonsense. Don\u2019t die. Try not to cry. Blame your controller. It\u2019s all part of the RUMBLE.",
